/E (This project successfully demonstrates the design and development of a user-friendly customer feedback form focused on usability, clarity, and accessibility. The form allows users to submit feedback efficiently through well-structured input fields and a simple, intuitive layout. Special emphasis was placed on maintaining a clean user interface, readable typography, and responsive design to ensure smooth interaction across different devices.)
